---
<details>
<summary>Methodology</summary>

- Claims were extracted per source by `{{ brief.stats.llm_provider }}`. Each claim carries a verbatim quote that was checked against the scraped text by fuzzy matching (threshold {{ threshold }}).
- {{ brief.stats.claims_extracted }} claims extracted → {{ brief.stats.claims_rejected_ungrounded }} rejected as ungrounded (quote not found in source), {{ brief.stats.claims_deduplicated }} duplicates removed.
- Consensus and contradiction groups were proposed by the LLM using claim IDs only. Code then checked that each group spans 2+ distinct sources; {{ brief.stats.groups_rejected }} groups failed that check and were discarded.
- Gaps are expected decision facets (generated from the topic alone); a facet counts as covered only if real claims are cited for it.
</details>

